{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgtkFVL2DRYpmmf6unoWR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Neuron 573's output is specific to doubt interjections. It promotes \"wait/Wait\" (top 11 tokens) and \"Hmm\" (rank 181), but is neutral on the re-expressed openers \"If\", \"Is\", \"Maybe\", \"So\", \"This\" and \"Let's\" (ranks above 20,000, values near zero). A stronger brake would block \"Wait\" harder but would not touch the restatement lines, which are the doubt state finding other words. The upstream \"keep re-examining\" state, not the interjection token, is now what sustains failures. Before choosing the next experiment, I want to see how a typical failure unfolds under the brake. I will take GSM8K cut samples where the correct answer appeared early, and sample the text every ~1,500 tokens from answer to loop onset. That will show whether the model keeps re-deriving the same answer, drifts into reading the question in alternative ways, or stalls in a verification ritual. Each pattern points to a different component.\n\n```python\n# Hypothesis: under brake x2, failures = answer found early, then long re-examination of alternative interpretations before restatement lock-in.\nex_ = LU11[(LU11.src.str.startswith('gsm')) & (LU11.has_ans == True) & (~LU11.doubt)].sample(3, random_state=5)\nfor _, r in ex_.iterrows():\n    rec = next(x for x in g11r if x['id'] == r['id']); s = rec['samples'][int(r['si'])]; enc_ = tok.encode(s['text'])\n    ans = str(rec['answer']); m = re.search(r'(?<![\\d.])' + re.escape(ans) + r'(?![\\d])', s['text']); first_c = m.start() if m else -1\n    first_t = next((i for i, o in enumerate(enc_.offsets) if o[0] >= first_c), -1)\n    print(f\"=== {r['id']} si{r['si']} ans {ans} first mention tok {first_t} loop onset {r['onset']} period {r['period']}\")\n    for tpos in list(range(max(first_t, 0), int(r['onset']), max(1500, (int(r['onset']) - first_t)//5)))[:6]:\n        c0_ = enc_.offsets[tpos][0]; print(f\"  @{tpos}: {asc_(squeeze(s['text'][c0_:c0_+170])).replace(chr(10), ' / ')}\")\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5608,"cache_read_input_tokens":131428,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5608},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b4bcd242-3053-49df-a015-76e7a59477b0","uuid":"d0cba627-2adc-404d-9fd1-68d30c8e34fb","timestamp":"2026-11-10T06:07:41.642Z","request_id":"req_011CgtkFU3ssyePnM9jgCZum"}
